  (text "POWER -- 12.6 V from P1 and 5 V from USB-C -- diode-OR, buck, LDO" (at 30 388 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "1a4cfc68-077d-456d-a4d8-617d9ed9b428"))
  (text "LOGIC -- machine interface, level stage, ESP32, both expanders" (at 30 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "d04e867e-b63e-4e05-942f-511e92a17863"))
  (text "PANEL -- the 11 lamps: 8 sourced by the panel expander, 3 sunk by it" (at 600 28 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "233e1714-a3db-45b6-8935-a4fc2f50fb89"))
  (text "AUDIO -- I2S class-D amp and the speaker" (at 600 348 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (thickness 0.4) bold) (justify left)) (uuid "69a98d59-033e-43be-bba5-c1b70964b4ab"))
  (text "wifi-comm-pac Rev A - O1NEXT WiFi COMM PAC (issues #324, #325, part of #56)" (at 30 545 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "d81efc1f-5611-4e4e-8ed0-22f76c736dfa"))
  (text "J1 is a 2x5 IDC: pin n = DE-9 pin n for 1..9; pin 10 is spare." (at 30 551 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "82d31ff9-102f-4c0a-8169-e7e3889c8eab"))
  (text "Pin 7 is +12.6 V DC direct from the machine (2.02 A rail), NOT via R21." (at 30 557 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "7433ac80-2de0-49d8-9af2-a2ef260e413f"))
  (text "U1/U2 translate the 5 V TTL side; U3 is the open-drain MSB sink." (at 30 563 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "49d5c6b8-2335-465e-95f2-d81f94e037e6"))
  (text "U4 MAX3232 runs on 3V3 so its drivers swing +/-5.5 V into the bipolar RXD." (at 30 569 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "19feb032-cd81-4f0b-9f96-91364b8b1682"))
  (text "U6 = panel expander 0x58 (P0 push-pull CC, P1 open-drain). U7 = handshake 0x59." (at 30 575 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "840ae68d-a11a-4757-9931-4a81221b0bb8"))
  (text "Both expanders are fitted: neither is full, so the pin budget is closed." (at 30 581 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "556ceead-4ea8-490c-b46d-84f3e169a10e"))
  (text "Power is diode-OR: 12.6 V -> 5 V path, and USB-C 5 V for bench work." (at 30 587 0) (effects (font (size 1.6 1.6)) (justify left)) (uuid "935ff14f-885d-461c-ab92-f3fbd3c161f4"))
